  "title": "Virtualmin virtual-server module 8.0.0 released",
  "summary": "Howdy all, We’ve rolled out Virtualmin virtual-server module 8.0.0 for all repos. Note this is not the Virtualmin 8 installer, which will be rolled out in a few hours. The Virtualmin virtual-server module does not add support for any new distros to the current stable Virtualmin 7 installer, so the supported OS list has not changed and won’t change until the new installer is pushed. Changes since 7.50.1: Add support for systemd resource limits for Virtualmin Pro users Add support for SFTP ba...",
